                <span>Thanh toán:</span>
                <span><i class="fa-solid fa-money-bill-wave" style="color: #2A9D8F; margin-right: 4px;"></i> COD (Kiểm hàng thanh toán)</span>
                <span><i class="fa-solid fa-qrcode" style="color: var(--gold-primary); margin-right: 4px;"></i> VNPAY-QR</span>
                <span><i class="fa-solid fa-building-columns" style="color: #3b82f6; margin-right: 4px;"></i> Chuyển khoản 24/7</span>
            </div>
        </div>
